('site-electricity','electricity','Can I buy an electricity token or pay a bill online right now?','Online payment is launching soon. For now you can submit an electricity request with your DisCo, meter or account number and amount, and our team will contact you to complete the transaction. No payment is taken on this website.',ARRAY['electricity','meter','token','bill'],'/get-electricity','Electricity requests','draft','site'),
