('site-payments','payments','How do I pay for electricity requests?','Online payment is launching soon. For now you can submit an electricity request with your DisCo, meter or account number and amount, and our team will contact you to complete the transaction. No payment is taken on this website. GET Energy never asks for payment by email or chat; only pay through a method our team confirms in writing.',ARRAY['payments','payment','online','token'],'/get-electricity','Electricity requests','draft','site'),
('site-wallet','payments','Is the GFA Wzip wallet live?','GFA Wzip Wallet: Payments · pending configuration. GET Energy never asks for payment by email or chat; only pay through a method our team confirms in writing.',ARRAY['wallet','gfa','wzip','payment'],'/technology','Technology','draft','site'),
('site-careers','careers','Are paid roles currently open?','No paid roles are open right now. Share your details through the form below and choose the closest position; we will contact you when a suitable role opens.',ARRAY['jobs','careers','paid','work'],'/careers','Careers','draft','site'),
('site-internship','internship','Are internships available?','Energy Operations and Digital Intern. Intern · Lagos, Nigeria · 6 weeks to 6 months training.',ARRAY['internship','intern','lagos'],'/careers','Careers','draft','site'),
